  "pitchStory": {
    "zh": "宜蘭三星的第三代稻農。父親那一代用慣行兩期作，水費電費年年漲、雜草越來越強。2022 年導入 AWD 間歇灌溉 + 殘株還田 — 同樣產量、水費省 30%、甲烷排放近半，土壤碳含量從 1.8% 升到 2.1%。MOA 有機驗證 2024 年通過。歡迎來田裡走一趟，數據是真的，土也是真的。",
    "en": "Third-generation rice farmer in Sanxing, Yilan. My father's generation ran double-crop continuous flooding — water and electricity costs rising yearly, weed pressure getting worse. In 2022 we adopted AWD (alternate wetting and drying) + residue retention. Same yield, 30% less water, methane down nearly half, soil organic carbon climbed from 1.8% to 2.1%. MOA organic cert came through in 2024. Come walk the field — the numbers are real and so is the soil."
  }
